OL,3,AMore than 12 US military aircraft leave
OL,4,Asecond UK base
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Wall Street Journal reported that
OL,7,Fthis week's departures have been in
OL,8,Fresponse to a further threat from Iran
OL,9,Fbut the BBC has not independently
OL,10,Fverified that claim.
OL,12,FDowning Street has insisted British
OL,13,Fairbases are safe and that their
OL,14,Fsecurity is a "top priority".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
